      "blocks": {
        "checklist": {
          "type": "custom-liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"at-checklist\"><div class=\"at-checklist__intro\"><p class=\"at-checklist__eyebrow\">Before you launch</p><h2 id=\"first-run\" class=\"at-checklist__title\">Plan your first run</h2></div><ol class=\"at-checklist__items\"><li><strong>Pick your type</strong><p>Choose the kind of brand you&rsquo;re building and start from its recommended line.</p></li><li><strong>Lock 2 or 3 colors</strong><p>Choose colors that come in every piece you plan to offer, not just the tee.</p></li><li><strong>Sample every piece</strong><p>Order the tee and layer in your colors. Shades can look different on jersey and fleece, even with the same name.</p></li><li><strong>Labels and decoration</strong><p>Check the neck label and test your artwork on the exact fabric and color before production.</p></li></ol><p class=\"at-checklist__note\"><strong>Planning a limited release?</strong> Work from the full launch quantity by size and color. Fewer colors can leave more of the budget for the garment itself.</p><p class=\"at-checklist__note\"><strong>Need kids&rsquo; sizes too?</strong> Explore <a href=\"/collections/family-matching-sets\">Family &amp; Matching Sets</a> for companion styles and colors across ages.</p></div>"
